          ],
          "content": "What is 5642 × 2?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.489,
            0.834,
            0.603
          ],
          "content": "While preparing visually-appealing presentations of data, we also need to be careful that the pictures we draw do not mislead us about the facts. In general, it is important to be careful when making or reading infographics, so that we do not mislead our intended audiences and we, ourselves, are not misled."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.372,
