            0.579,
            0.67
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Summary"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.695,
            0.834,
            0.739
          ],
          "content": "Facts, numbers, measures, observations and other descriptions of things that convey information about those things is called **data**."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.741,
            0.833,
            0.784
          ],
          "content": "■ Data can be organised in a tabular form using tally marks for easy analysis and interpretation."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.787,
            0.834,
            0.829
          ],
          "content": "**Frequencies** are the counts of the occurrences of values, measures or observations."
        },
